                size: 4
                desc:
                  '''
                  Scrambling and ECC configuration overrides (set by the ROM)
                  for the Creator and OwnerSeed NVM (flash or RRAM) info
                  pages that are hardwired to the keygmr. By default,
                  scrambling and ECC on these info pages must be enabled in
                  order to successfully crank the keygmr (in the ROM_EXT).
                  However, values of kMultiBitBool4True for each subfield in
